Third-party components
----------------------

sherpa-onnx (https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx), Apache License 2.0
  - Static libraries and C API header downloaded by scripts/fetch-sherpa.sh
  - Plume/Plume/Support/SherpaOnnx.swift is vendored from its Swift API examples
  The static libraries include ONNX Runtime and other components under their own licenses.

Speaker diarization models, downloaded by scripts/fetch-sherpa.sh and bundled with release builds:
  - pyannote segmentation 3.0 (sherpa-onnx export)
  - NVIDIA NeMo TitaNet small speaker embedding model
  Each model is under its own license, which may require attribution or limit use.
  Check the current terms of both before distributing or commercializing.
